    "body": "Beans Route allows you to add a time commitment window for drop-offs or pickups.  To add a time commitment window to a stop, follow the steps below. From Dispatch Console: 1.  Click on the route number to open the detailed view of the route.  2.  Locate the stop in the manifest, click on the address card to highlight it, and then click the “Modify Stop” button.  3.  In the Modify Stop menu, scroll to the “Deliver By” option and click on the line to open the calendar.  4.  Select the delivery date on the calendar.  5.  Click on the second line to open the clock and select the deliver by time.   6.  Click “Save.”",
